==Strategy==
The Snowballs in this stage inflict highest the damage among the snowballs found in previous stages (4,800 damage, enough to kill a Lv. 20 [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]]), so be wary of them. Spam meatshields to protect stronger cats attacking Mammothe, Icy Doges and the enemy Base. Using fast hitting cats with good movement speed like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]], [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], etc. it is possible to beat this stage in under 2 minutes.

==='''Strategy 1 (~1 min Speedrun)'''===
{{Lineup
|Crazed Macho Cat|30
|Crazed Wall Cat|30
|Crazed Brave Cat|30
|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat|30
|Crazed Giraffe Cat|30
|Awakened Bahamut Cat|30
}}

Wait and let the first round of Snowballs hit your base until Crazed Sexy Legs Cat's [[Wave Attack|wave]] will take out the last one or two. Spawn a Crazed Sexy Legs Cat, and three sets of Crazed Macho Cats and Crazed Wall Cats, then a Crazed Giraffe Cat and two more Machos, and wait. After the boss shockwave, spawn another Giraffe and then A. Bahamut. Keep spamming Machos and Giraffes to ensure Bahamut is protected from the Snowballs.

