==Trivia==
*Like all [[Cats in the Snow]] stages, Icy Desire's Japanese name, Gerende ga Tokeruhodo Koi Shitai ("A Dead Body so in Love That it Melts the Slopes"), is a reference to a song, in this case "[https://youtu.be/MRfnpEf54eM Gerende ga Tokeru Hodo Koishitai]" ("I Want to Fall so in Love That it Melts the Slopes") by [[wikipedia:Kohmi Hirose|Kohmi Hirose]].

